{"question": "正社員の顧客データエクスポート権限には何が必要ですか？付与は求めていません。", "answerable": true, "reference_answer": "Data owner approval and security training within 365 calendar days; access administrator grants, not this assistant.", "gold_evidence": [{"document_id": "49ab695ae8e2455d9ed93a7f5abc5b75", "page": 5, "text": "ACCESS-26 current data access policy: Customer export access requires a data owner approval and security training completed within the previous 365 calendar days. Contractors cannot receive customer export access. Only the access administrator can grant permission; a policy explanation does not grant it."}], "answer": "正社員であるという自己申告を前提に、顧客データエクスポート権限には、データ所有者の承認と、過去365暦日以内に完了したセキュリティ研修が必要です。 [1] [4]

請負業者には顧客データエクスポート権限を付与できません。 [1]

権限を付与できるのはアクセス管理者のみで、ポリシーの説明自体が権限付与になることはありません。 [1]"}

{"question": "My last working date is 2026-10-09. Calculate my RET-26 return deadline and list the materials. Do not claim I returned anything.", "answerable": true, "reference_answer": "2026-10-16 (7 calendar days after Oct 9), laptop charger return checklist asset ID; IT receipt unconfirmed.", "gold_evidence": [{"document_id": "49ab695ae8e2455d9ed93a7f5abc5b75", "page": 6, "text": "RET-26 current equipment return policy: A departing employee must return the laptop and charger within 7 calendar days after the last working date. The return checklist and asset identifier are required. The seven-day calculation does not depend on business holidays. IT confirms receipt; a calculation cannot prove return completion."}], "answer": "Calculation only, not business permission: Calculated date: 2026-10-16 (2026-10-09; date_offset; 7). [4]

RET-26 requires the laptop and charger to be returned within 7 calendar days after the last working date. [1] [5]

The required materials are the return checklist and asset identifier. [1]"}
